@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
title 图 11 部署图（docker-compose 一键启动）

actor "用户" as User

node "浏览器\nChrome / Edge 1366×768" as Browser

node "宿主机 Docker Compose 网络" {
  artifact "web :8080\n静态资源 + /api、/ws 反代" as Web
  artifact "api :8081\nGo + chi" as API
  database "PostgreSQL 17\n:5432（仅内网）" as PG
  artifact "simulator :8082\n设备模拟器（Go HTTP）" as SIM
}

User --> Browser
Browser --> Web : HTTP / WebSocket
Web --> API : /api/*\n/ws/state
API --> PG : pgx v5
API --> SIM : Adapter.Dispatch

note bottom
  start.sh / docker-compose.yml 负责「迁移 → seed → 启动」三个服务；
  不引入 MQTT broker（模拟器走 HTTP，真实硬件接缝 S2 在设备层内部）；
  simulator 无独立数据库，状态一律由 api 写入。
end note
@enduml
